[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737951558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104300#issuecomment-2737951558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104300","id":2737951558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jMdNG","user":{"login":"onnileivo","id":95504630,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFI9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504630?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo","html_url":"https://github.com/onnileivo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onnileivo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T19:58:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T19:58:29Z","body":"This is caused by `previous_position` not being initialized and only updated in `move_and_slide()`\nSo when `get_position_delta()` is called before `move_and_slide()`, `previous_position` defaults to zero.\n```cpp\nVector2 CharacterBody2D::get_position_delta() const {\n\treturn get_global_transform().columns[2] - previous_position; // previous_position = (0,0), so returns position\n}\n```\n`previous_position` could be initialized to the position of the object\nLike in the constructor for example\n\nnew here could be wrong","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737951558/reactions","total_